(text "Power Supplies and Inputs" (at 12 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c6a019b-4123-5514-abce-bcfeebd9893d"))
(text "Named nets connect the circuit blocks on this sheet and across the hierarchy." (at 12 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6d38520c-46bf-5149-8ce3-69748ff26d94"))
(text "12 V input - two GPU 8-pin OR one EPS 8-pin" (at 12.0 45 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "530d9f1e-0d99-5c82-b12a-e800b799a898"))
(text "Choose GPU pair OR EPS with a break-before-make selector rated >=30 A, >=24 VDC. Do not switch under load.\nGPU pair MUST come from the same PSU. Both GPU connectors required for full output. Do not combine separate PSUs.\nConnector pin numbering is the electrical interface: verify keying, mating face and selected manufacturer drawing before layout." (at 12.0 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1a7743a-291e-5882-8f92-dacee5a5e872"))
(text "LM51772 - programmable 5-20 V / 100 W" (at 596.2 45 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8005ed8f-37ae-5848-85c5-3142c718cb56"))
(text "WEBENCH Design103 adapted for I2C (ADDR=GND, address 0x6A), internal feedback and MCU enable/reset.\nAPS1040M2R2A replaces 1.8 uH. Compensation and current limit require recalculation/testing before power-up.\nAll bridge FETs standardized to CSD17577Q3A (30 V). Not an EPR design. Maximum contract 20 V / 5 A." (at 596.2 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f2397f6-2a51-5490-afb4-27aa8378d47f"))
(text "5 V / 12 A - TPS40305" (at 12.0 268.53999999999996 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b0993d5-f8aa-529e-a27a-b943acd56528"))
(text "WEBENCH Design105 topology and values; 1.2 MHz. MOSFET drain pad numbering follows TI NexFET land pattern.\n5 V allocation: two Type-C ports at 3 A, USB-A SDP loads, plus VCONN/mux overhead. BC1.2 disabled." (at 12.0 275.53999999999996 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b0d2272b-d0ac-570b-8d76-a57544b59730"))
(text "3.3 V / 4 A - TPS56A37" (at 596.2 372.68 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d6ed298a-9d18-5da9-9791-2de5606c7c51"))
(text "WEBENCH Design104 values. EN intentionally floating per datasheet section 6.3.5.\nAGND/PGND join at regulator. Verify capacitance after DC-bias derating and inductor thermal limits." (at 596.2 379.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57fce388-b7d1-5dc2-997f-198a7d107f18"))
(text "1.15 V / 3 A - USB7206C core" (at 12.0 497.1400000000001 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29cb37ef-3483-58d2-9a9f-1d5579eeda92"))
(text "TPS62130, 12 V input. 0.8 V reference x (1 + 43.7k/100k) = 1.1496 V.\nHub VCORE allowed range 1.09-1.21 V. Hold HUB_RESET_N low until both hub rails are stable." (at 12.0 504.1400000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21feab6c-5426-5157-ae1c-d4585242149b"))
